Subject: Preserve original THPSimple with native Wii data and scalar ABI
Upstream-base: 0f5a757947b8778b680d4d1ae7e6df1792a514f2

Keep original initialization, movie selection, NL requests, preload/ring order,
component dispatch, mixing, callback chaining and retail quirks. Adapt Wii32
long arithmetic, the original64-byte workbuffer, exact48/20/12/16-byte THP
records, four-byte big-endian frame words and pointer-width NL callbacks.
Native decoding calls the actual prepared Aurora SDK interface. AI DMA/address,
original positive readiness, GPU and decoder quarter-IDCT fidelity remain
unqualified; no successful SDK or game substitute is supplied by this patch.

